WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:02.810
Project information is everywhere.

2
00:00:02.810 --> 00:00:06.100
Confidence starts when it becomes one clear project picture.

3
00:00:06.100 --> 00:00:11.580
Mantiva360 connects plans, risks, forecasts and evidence
into a connected project view.

4
00:00:11.580 --> 00:00:14.000
Resolve gaps. Strengthen evidence.

5
00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:15.380
Connect cause to action.

6
00:00:15.380 --> 00:00:16.720
Recheck the position.

7
00:00:16.720 --> 00:00:20.910
Then stay in control with attention,
anticipation and assurance.

8
00:00:20.910 --> 00:00:22.990
Less time reconstructing status.

9
00:00:22.990 --> 00:00:24.980
More time controlling delivery.

10
00:00:24.980 --> 00:00:27.220
Mantiva360. Data to Progress.
